      "content": "but that's the thing... there is no \"pushing forward.\" there's nothing left to push for. i look at my bank account, my empty apartment, the way people look at me like i'm some kind of pariah... it doesn't feel like i'm on a \"meaningful path.\" it feels like i've been cast out of society. like i'm already dead, just walking around. i just don't see how any of this makes sense anymore. how do you even keep going when the reward for being a good person is just getting destroyed?",
